### StopNShop API Smoke Tests
#
# Append a new ### block every time a flow is verified to work.
# Each block: name, last-verified date, status, payload.
# Before merging any change, run all blocks here. Any non-2xx = regression.
#
# How to run:
#   - VS Code: install "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client), then click "Send Request" above each ### block.
#   - CLI: copy the curl equivalent at the bottom of each block.
#
# Auth tokens: replace {{customerToken}} / {{sellerToken}} after a successful login below.

@host = http://localhost:5000
@customerToken = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN
@sellerToken   = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN


### [PUBLIC] GET megamenu — verified 2026-05-12, 200
GET {{host}}/api/menu


### [PUBLIC] GET product list by category — verified 2026-05-12, 200
GET {{host}}/api/products?categoryId=1&sortBy=Newest


### [PUBLIC] GET categories dropdown
GET {{host}}/api/categories


### [PUBLIC] GET subcategories for category 1
GET {{host}}/api/categories/1/subcategories


### [PUBLIC] GET brands
GET {{host}}/api/brands


### [CUSTOMER AUTH] login — paste token into @customerToken above on success
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}


### [SELLER AUTH] login — paste token into @sellerToken above on success
POST {{host}}/api/seller/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller@test.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}


### [SELLER] list my products
GET {{host}}/api/seller/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}


### [SELLER] get product detail (edit-page load)
# Confirms: brandId, categoryId, subCategoryId, tags, imageUrls, colors, sizes are all populated.
GET {{host}}/api/seller/products/71
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}


### [SELLER] create product — minimal valid payload
POST {{host}}/api/seller/products
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Test Polo",
  "description": "Created by smoke test",
  "brandId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "subCategoryId": 4,
  "mrp": 1500,
  "sellingPrice": 999,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "lowStockThreshold": 2,
  "imageUrls": [],
  "colors": ["Blue"],
  "sizes": ["M"],
  "tags": ["men", "polos", "casual-wear"]
}


### [SELLER] update product — full payload (mirrors Edit page submit)
# After running, GET /api/seller/products/<id> and confirm every field round-trips.
PUT {{host}}/api/seller/products/71
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anarkali",
  "description": "Clothes",
  "brandId": 9,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "subCategoryId": 4,
  "mrp": 1000,
  "sellingPrice": 1200,
  "stockQuantity": 13,
  "lowStockThreshold": 10,
  "imageUrls": ["/uploads/products/faa34c74-ce2f-4b7c-99c4-796b9ad91dd4.png"],
  "colors": ["Blue", "Red"],
  "sizes": ["S"],
  "tags": ["women", "clothing"]
}


### [CUSTOMER] search products
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?q=polo
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### [CUSTOMER] product detail
GET {{host}}/api/products/71


